        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Set forth below is a description of the background of Ms. Reeve, our executive officer other than Mr.&#160;Snyder, whose background is described under &#8220;</font><font style="font-style:italic;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Proposals to be Voted On&#8201;&#8212;&#8201;Proposal 1: Election of Directors</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">.&#8221; </font>
        </div>
        <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="font-style:italic;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Lana Reeve</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> has served as our Chief Financial and Legal Officer since December&#160;2022. Ms.&#160;Reeve brings over 25&#160;years of experience in senior legal and finance roles at both large and small and public and private companies. Prior to her current role, Ms.&#160;Reeve previously served as President and Chief Legal Officer at Authentys, Inc., Senior Vice President, Legal M&amp;A at RealPage, Inc., and Executive Vice President, Finance and Legal, and Chief Legal Officer at NWP Services Corporation. Ms.&#160;Reeve received her J.D. from Santa Clara University School of Law and her B.S. in business and finance from San Jose State University. </font>
        </div>
      </div>
