          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Includes (i)&#160;10,658 shares of Class&#160;A Common Stock issuable upon exercise of stock options within 60&#160;days after April&#160;26, 2023; and (ii)&#160;8,695 restricted shares of Class&#160;A Common Stock that vest 33% annually, starting on March&#160;28, 2022, such that on March&#160;28, 2025, the restricted shares of Class&#160;A Common Stock will be 100% vested. As of April&#160;26, 2023, 2,898 of Mr.&#160;Snyder&#8217;s restricted shares of Class&#160;A Common Stock have vested. </font>
