          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Includes (i) 29,713 shares of Class A Common Stock issuable upon exercise of stock options within 60 days after April 26, 2023; and (ii) 23,976 restricted shares of Class A Common Stock that vest 33% annually, starting on March 10, 2022, such than on March 10, 2025, the restricted shares of Class A Common Stock will be 100% vested. As of April 26, 2023, 7,992 of Mr. Kovacevich&#8217;s restricted shares of Class A Common Stock have vested. </font>
        </div>
