        <div style=" margin-top:4pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:20pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Based solely upon the Schedule&#160;13G filed with the SEC by the beneficial owner on February&#160;8, 2023 reporting beneficial ownership as of December&#160;31, 2022, Hudson Bay Capital Management LP and Sander Gerber possess shared voting shared dispositive power over 1,753,994 shares. </font>
        </div>
